COMPILATION OF: E52C

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52C

   1 a 0000 E52C:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] DEC OUTER / BINARY INNER (homonym i): outer i
   4 a 0006      fixed dec(4,2), inner i fixed bin, both i = 3. The inner store
   5 a 0006      is the discriminator: lexical resolution types it BINARY --
   6 a 0006      LXI H,immediate 0003 / SHLD, NO pool cell (pool stays 3 for
   7 a 0006      the outer store); a global outer-typed map wrongly routes it
   8 a 0006      through the DEC path LXI H,*S + DLDOP + ?DSTOP and would also
   9 a 0006      need the pool. Same DATA either way (predicted 3 pool + 3 + 2
  10 a 0006      vars), CODE BYTES distinguish. MINE refuses today (Vdec vs
  11 a 0006      Vint clash). */
  12 c 0006   dcl i fixed dec(4,2);
  13 c 0006   i = 3;
  14 c 0016   call q;
  15 c 0019   q: procedure;
  16 e 0019      dcl i fixed bin;
  17 e 001C      i = 3;
  18 c 0023      end q;
  19 a 0023 end E52C;

CODE SIZE = 0026
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38A9
END  COMPILATION
